{"language": "phone", "concept": "一支深夜還亮著的手機：「我」對著星空傳出得不到回應的心意，另一個聲音卻一直回覆「這顆星球很美啊」。兩人的天文對話從黃昏的天文台、藍色的地平線、銀河鹽湖一路走到雨夜、黎明與無垠星海。最後終於等到一句回覆，說的卻是「宇宙裡沒有你的容身之處」。", "styleAnchor": {"prompt": "Deep indigo night palette with saturated coral and warm gold light bands at the horizon, deep inky shadows, crisp bright starlight, layered clouds with clear foreground and background depth, longing quiet astronomical mood, high contrast, no grey haze. No text, no letters, no logos.", "palette": {"background": "#0B0F2E", "text": "#F4F1FF", "accent": "#FF7A59", "line": "#7FA8FF", "glow": "#FFD27A"}}, "assets": [{"id": "img_rooftop", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Flat apartment rooftop at night with an old brass refractor telescope on a tripod pointing up into a dense star field, water tank silhouette at the edge, distant city lights glowing coral along the horizon, thin layered clouds drifting in the foreground and far background, wide open sky in the upper two thirds."}, {"id": "img_dome", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Small white observatory dome on a grassy hill at deep blue dusk, its slit open toward the sky, first stars appearing, a bright coral and gold afterglow band along the horizon, layered clouds in front of and behind the hill, lots of empty sky above."}, {"id": "img_earthlimb", "kind": "image", "prompt": "The curved blue edge of planet Earth seen from the upper atmosphere at dawn, a thin glowing cyan and gold atmospheric band along the arc, white cloud tops far below, deep indigo-black space above with scattered stars, layered cloud banks near and far for depth."}, {"id": "img_milkyway", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Milky Way arching over a mirror-flat salt lake at night, the galaxy reflected in the still water, a bright magenta and gold glow at the horizon, low layered clouds drifting near the horizon in the foreground and far distance, deep indigo sky."}, {"id": "img_cosmos", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Endless sea of clouds at night seen from a high mountain ridge, a vast dense starfield with a violet nebula glow above, a bright warm light band where the clouds meet the sky, foreground cloud wisps close to the camera and distant cloud layers far away."}, {"id": "img_overpass", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Empty pedestrian overpass above a quiet suburban road at night, a single warm streetlamp, car light trails streaking far below, indigo starry sky with drifting layered clouds, coral glow of the city at the horizon."}, {"id": "img_arcade", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Covered shopping arcade street at night after rain, glowing blank colorful signboards and paper lanterns in pink, cyan and gold, wet pavement reflecting the neon, nobody around, a strip of starry night sky with clouds visible at the far end of the arcade."}, {"id": "img_rainstop", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Lonely bus stop shelter on a rainy night road, a flickering streetlamp casting a cold blue-white cone of light through falling rain, wet asphalt with long reflections, heavy deep blue clouds layered overhead with a faint orange city glow underneath."}, {"id": "img_birds", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Dawn sky over a high sea cliff, a small flock of distant birds flying across, clouds streaming in layers from near to far, a brilliant gold sun band rising at the ocean horizon, deep blue upper sky."}, {"id": "img_sunrise", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Riverside embankment at sunrise, a long empty path along the water, power line towers in the distance, sky filled with layered pink and golden clouds near and far, the sun bursting at the horizon and reflecting in the river."}, {"id": "img_abyss", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Deep rocky canyon at night viewed from its rim, crimson and violet glow rising from far below, dense stars overhead, layered mist clouds drifting inside the canyon at different depths."}, {"id": "img_outro", "kind": "image", "prompt": "Tiny lighthouse on a dark rocky islet in a vast calm ocean at night, its small beam reaching out, an overwhelming starfield filling the sky, a thin indigo and gold glow at the far horizon, low clouds layered over the water near and far."}], "shots": [{"id": "s01", "start": 0, "end": 11.66, "template": "title-card", "params": {"layout": "center", "hold": 9, "dim": 0.3}, "asset": "img_rooftop", "camera": "push", "transitionIn": "cut"}, {"id": "s02", "start": 11.66, "end": 15.12, "template": "input", "params": {"after": "send", "size": 80}, "asset": "img_dome", "camera": "pan", "transitionIn": "flash"}, {"id": "s03", "start": 15.12, "end": 20.82, "template": "chat", "params": {"side": "right", "read": "none", "theme": "dark", "corner": 0.35, "glow": true}, "asset": "img_dome", "camera": "parallax", "transitionIn": "cut"}, {"id": "s04", "start": 20.82, "end": 30.62, "template": "chat", "params": {"side": "left", "theme": "dark", "corner": 0.35, "glow": true, "zoom": 1.6}, "asset": "img_earthlimb", "camera": "push", "transitionIn": "wipe"}, {"id": "s05", "start": 30.62, "end": 40.78, "template": "notify", "params": {"from": "あなた"}, "asset": "img_earthlimb", "camera": "pan", "transitionIn": "cut"}, {"id": "s06", "start": 40.78, "end": 45.6, "template": "input", "params": {"after": "delete", "size": 84}, "asset": "img_dome", "camera": "push", "transitionIn": "dissolve"}, {"id": "s07", "start": 45.6, "end": 50.5, "template": "chat", "params": {"side": "right", "read": "none", "theme": "dark", "corner": 0.35, "glow": true, "size": 72}, "asset": "img_milkyway", "camera": "push", "transitionIn": "cut"}, {"id": "s08", "start": 50.5, "end": 55.84, "template": "input", "params": {"after": "send", "size": 84}, "asset": "img_cosmos", "camera": "parallax", "transitionIn": "cut"}, {"id": "s09", "start": 55.84, "end": 61.58, "template": "chat", "params": {"side": "right", "read": "read", "theme": "dark", "corner": 0.35, "glow": true, "size": 72}, "asset": "img_milkyway", "camera": "pan", "transitionIn": "wipe"}, {"id": "s10", "start": 61.58, "end": 70.76, "template": "chat", "params": {"side": "right", "rea